# skyeGairdin — Uathach in her kata garden
#
# Idle lines between kata, and the sos (break) talks: the scene sets
# sos_1, sos_2, sos_3 every second kata finished and opens this card.
# She talks about the discipline: footwork, pattern, thought -- and, last,
# a thread for the constellations (see the omen in skyeGairdin.js).
#
# IRISH IS A FIRST DRAFT -- check before shipping.

@file skye/skyeGairdin


# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
= node 0 — idle, before the first break
@when !note sos_1
@hold
Stand in the middle when you're ready.
% Seas sa lár nuair atá tú réidh.
Stay as long as you like. Come back whenever you like.
% Fan chomh fada agus is mian leat. Fill aon uair is mian leat.


# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
= node 1 — sos: the feet first
@when note sos_1
@when !note sos_1_heard
@note sos_1_heard
@continue
Rest a moment.
% Lig do scíth nóiméad.
Everything else is built on the feet.
% Tá gach rud eile tógtha ar na cosa.
Sword, spear, bow: without the feet, they're only wood and iron.
% Claíomh, sleá, bogha: gan na cosa, níl iontu ach adhmad agus iarann.


# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
= node 2 — idle
@when !note sos_2
@hold
Again, whenever you like.
% Arís, aon uair is mian leat.


# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
= node 3 — sos: the word and the foot
@when note sos_2
@when !note sos_2_heard
@note sos_2_heard
@continue
When the feet follow the word without thinking, the mind is free.
% Nuair a leanann na cosa an focal gan smaoineamh, bíonn an intinn saor.
That's why we walk them again, and again.
% Sin é an fáth a siúlaimid arís iad, agus arís eile.


# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
= node 4 — idle
@when !note sos_3
@hold
The stones don't mind how often you walk them.
% Is cuma leis na clocha cé chomh minic a shiúlann tú orthu.


# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
= node 5 — sos: older than the board
@when note sos_3
@when !note sos_3_heard
@note sos_3_heard
@continue
Some of these patterns are older than the board.
% Tá cuid de na patrúin seo níos sine ná an clár.
They came down from the sky, they say.
% Tháinig siad anuas ón spéir, a deirtear.


# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
= node 6 — idle, for good
@hold
The stones will be here.
% Beidh na clocha anseo.
